{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:35 2026-06-06 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:35 2026-06-06 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:35 2026-06-06 HKT</p><p>今（6日）晨10時許，大埔大窩西支路泰亨村一間園藝工程公司起火，濃煙席捲半空，消防到場拖喉灌救，一小時後將火救熄，事件中無人受傷，疏散約10人，起火原因仍待調查。</p><img alt=\"大埔大窩西支路泰亨村一間園藝工程公司起火。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f2ab41f8045be3f5fee5f1408e1a4e69/2026-06/01_2_19.jpg\"/><img alt=\"濃煙席捲半空。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c95a94019f12a54bcb7e5f6d375d5629/2026-06/10_0_12.jpg\"/><img alt=\"濃煙席捲半空。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f0b40b0e1edf1350f9b9059667111f7d/2026-06/02_2_17.jpg\"/><img alt=\"濃煙席捲半空。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4394692773c16a7710bd61ee11b466ab/2026-06/03_1_14.jpg\"/><img alt=\"濃煙席捲半空。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d37804a2ff09c146ff3df2f8c756edea/2026-06/04_6_15.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場煙霧瀰漫。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/80f8f051455cf7a4ec45d602e4263705/2026-06/04_3_17.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-06T04:23:16.719947+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}